  "releaseNotes": "Version 1.0.3.0 - NuGet Package Fix\n      - Fixed icon URL to use root-level path (no encoding issues)\n      - Fixed README.md path for NuGet.org display\n      - Embedded icon in package for offline compatibility\n      - Corrected copyright year to 2025\n      - All files now properly validated for XrmToolBox compliance\n\n      Version 1.0.2.0 - Icon Fix\n      - Fixed icon URL to point to main branch\n      - Embedded icon in NuGet package for better compatibility\n      - Updated iconUrl for XrmToolBox validation\n\n      Version 1.0.1.0 - Packaging Update\n      - Updated icon URL for initial publication\n\n      Version 1.0.0.0 - Initial Release\n      - Visual entity selection with search functionality\n      - Custom action support for Dataverse workflows\n      - Target framework selection (.NET 8.0 and 9.0)\n      - Secure credential management using Windows Credential Manager\n      - Complete MCP project generation with ZIP export\n      - Claude Desktop integration support\n      - Real-time progress tracking during generation\n      - Password visibility toggle for client secrets\n      - Async operations prevent UI freezing\n      - Responsive design that adapts to window resizing",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": false,
  "summary": "Visual code generator that transforms Dataverse metadata into production-ready Model Context Protocol servers with AI agent integration",
